<<<
jihad, je-. Until recently the second spelling was usual; but the OED gives the first as the right. Jill. See cr. JINGLES, or the unintended repetition of the same word or similar sounds, are dealt with in the article REPETITION OF WORDS & SOUNDS. A few examples
===
**jihad, je-.** Until recently the second spelling was usual; but the OED gives the first as the right.

**Jill.** See ^^GILL^^.

**JINGLES**, or the unintended repetition of the same word or similar sounds, are dealt with in the article ^^REPETITION OF WORDS & SOUNDS^^. A few examples
>>>

<<<
The sport of the air is still far from free from danger./Mr Leon Dominian has amassed for us a valuable mass of statistics./The situation had so far developed so little that nothing useful can be said about it, save that
===
The sport of the air is still far *from* free *from* danger./Mr Leon Dominian has a*mass*ed for us a valuable *mass* of statistics./The situation had *so* *far* developed *so* little that nothing useful can be said about it, save that
